      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But that's the thing. A good person would have stepped in. A person with a real conscience wouldn't have just stood there like a coward. The fact that I just watched... it feels like my soul is just rotten. Like no matter what I do now, I can't undo that. I don't think I'm just \"learning.\" I think I'm just fundamentally wrong. I don't even feel like I belong here anymore.",
